  "_id": "qbZxZ7QbwTJJCawl",
  "name": "石匠战镐 Stonemaker War Pick (BMT)",
  "type": "weapon",
  "system": {
    "source": {
      "custom": "",
      "book": "BMT",
      "page": "68",
      "license": "",
      "rules": "2014",
      "revision": 1
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>武器（战镐），极珍稀（需同调）</p><p>你用这把魔法战镐发动的攻击检定与其伤害掷骰具有+1加值。且它具有以下的特殊属性：</p><ul><li><h3>融身入石Meld into Stone。</h3><p>你可以用这把战镐施展法术<em>@UUID[Compendium.dnd5e_classpack.spell.Item.pJ6hE8Vab5Ypuqm4]{融身入石 Meld into Stone}</em>。一旦此属性被使用，直到次日黎明前不能被再次使用。</p></li><li><h3>石化Petrification。</h3><p>这把战镐具有[[/r 1d6 + 1]]发充能。如果你对一个生命值不满100点的生物掷出了一次重击，你可以消耗1发充能，迫使该生物通过一次[[/save ability=con dc=15]]豁免。豁免失败时，生物将陷入 <strong>石化Petrified</strong> 状态，持续8小时。当战镐的充能数归零后，它失去这条属性。</p></li></ul><p>You gain a +1 bonus to attack and damage rolls made with this magic war pick. It has the following special properties:</p><ul><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Meld into Stone\"><span class=\"bold\">Meld into Stone.</span> You can cast the @spell[Meld into Stone] spell from this war pick. Once this property is used, it can't be used again until the next dawn.</p></li><li><p data-roll-name-ancestor=\"Petrification\"><span class=\"bold\">Petrification.</span> The war pick has [[/r 1d6 + 1]] charges. If you score a critical hit against a creature that has fewer than 100 hit points, you can expend 1 charge from the war pick to have that creature make a [[/save ability=con dc=15]] saving throw. On a failed save, the creature has the petrified condition for 8 hours. When the war pick has no charges remaining, it loses this property.</p></li></ul>",
      "chat": ""
    },
